    {
      "id": "b000014",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 21,
      "end_line": 23,
      "raw": "- `WhatSonPermissionBootstrapper` was consolidated from `src/app/runtime/permissions` into this domain so permission\n  request policy and platform bridge implementations stay in one module boundary.\n- Runtime startup orchestrators consume this module rather than owning permission policy directly.\n",
      "items": [
