    },
    {
      "id": "b000017",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 26,
      "end_line": 30,
      "raw": "- Consumed by `main.cpp` startup wiring.\n- Depends on Qt permission APIs (`QPermission`, `QMicrophonePermission`, `QCalendarPermission`, `QLocationPermission`)\n  and Apple bridge request functions.\n  plugins. In that mode, the bootstrapper still requests Apple-bridge permissions but skips Qt runtime permission\n  steps that would otherwise depend on the excluded plugin type.\n",
